    test(hybrid): update state_abi contract tests to the shipped v4 wire format

    The pinned ABI submodule moved to HYBRID_STATE_VERSION 4 (appends
    struct hybrid_m_ext_csr, 51 * 8 bytes, after the v3 andes block) but the
