    total size, and the reserved-tail offset. Lock the v4 layout instead:
    version 4, m_ext offset/order, and the size expressed from the two
    block sizeofs so the next block addition fails loudly here again.

    Behavioral test correction only; no production code change.

    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>

